          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4305898,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered Monday through Saturday from 8:30 AM to 6:00 PM.\n\nIf you arrive up to 10 minutes after your appointment time, you will still be seen, but the appointment may be shorter so that the patients booked after you are not kept waiting. If you arrive more than 15 minutes late for a GP or specialist appointment, or more than 10 minutes late for a dental appointment, we may not be able to see you, and you will be asked to choose a new time. Dental appointments have the shorter limit because the treatment room has to be prepared and cleaned between patients.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.38706768,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## Checking in on time\n\nCheck in at the front desk or at the self-check-in kiosk as soon as you arrive. Your arrival is recorded when you check in, not when you enter the building.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 28,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.38599044,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your registration paperwork. Returning patients can arrive 5 to 10 minutes prior to their slot.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.36208242,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 22,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.35687822,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.35551482,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minutes behind, the front desk will tell you w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.35076517,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": 2.8228528,
          "lexical_rank": 9,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 26,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.32913506,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express),",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.30986494,
