          "similarity_score": 0.2741738,
          "dense_rank": 18,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.27290452,
          "dense_rank": 19,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 37,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.26826128,
          "dense_rank": 20,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medical examinations, pilot medicals or immigration medical examinations. A",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 30,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2679649,
          "dense_rank": 21,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## What a dental appointment covers\n\nA routine dental appointment includes an examination of your teeth and gums and a professional cleaning. Fillings and extractions are usually d",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.26651424,
          "dense_rank": 22,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank details, Social Security number or insurance member ID by text message",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 25,
          "chunk_index": 0,
